# __PROJECT_NAME__

This local scene sync project was generated by zeroServer `scripts/NewLocalGame.java --template scene-sync`.

## Run

First install the current zeroServer SNAPSHOT into the local Maven repository:

~~~powershell
mvn -q -DskipTests install
~~~

Then run these commands in this project directory:

~~~powershell
mvn -q clean test
mvn -q exec:java
~~~

Expected output:

~~~text
scene-sync=ok|mode=local|name=__PROJECT_NAME__|summary=scene=scene-1,entities=3,focus=1001,visible=2,visibleIds=1002,1003,lastDelta=move:1003@8,8|logs=6|metrics=5|maxProtocolId=92105
~~~

